Rolling linux apps 2.1.12
-------------------------------------------

Packaging compliance release (Canonical review 2026-11):

* ini configuration files are now dpkg conffiles (Policy 10.7): they ship
  directly in /etc/rolling/config_file/, dpkg owns upgrade/merge/purge, and
  the postinst no longer seeds /etc.
* runtime data moved from /usr/share/rolling to /usr/share/linux-apps
  (FHS /usr/share/<package> naming).
* preinst migrates operator-edited ini files from the legacy
  /etc/opt/rolling layout before unpack.

Rolling linux apps 1.0.0
-------------------------------------------

This is a new stable release of Rolling Linux services.  Notable changes include:

* systemd integration
* flash service
* config service
* ma service
* helper service
